                "text": "In today\u2019s Medicaid Moment, I wanted to discuss how cuts to Medicaid will impact all of us. Even if you don\u2019t rely on Medicaid for your health insurance, the ripple effects of Republicans\u2019 Big Beautiful Bill will impact all of our care. https://t.co/aaupz3BCDN",
