                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The best parts of my district work weeks are being back in the MD03 community and talking about the issues that impact you most. At @HoCoHCCA's annual meeting, we talked about the importance of investing in our schools and healthcare system. As your representative on Capitol Hill, I can\u2019t do my job without hearing from all of you. A special thank you to President Stu Kohn for your commitment and leadership on behalf of Howard County.",
