                "reply_count": 7,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Yesterday, the Supreme Court ruled that states can cut off Medicaid funding to Planned Parenthood - even for care not related to abortion. This dangerous decision uses the pretext of abortion to defund and deny cancer screenings, prenatal services, and other forms of life-saving care. Patients should have more health care options, not less.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
