                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "House Democrats are united in voting against President Trump\u2019s Big Ugly Bill. When it comes to gutting Medicaid, slashing SNAP, and cutting millions of jobs, we\u2019re voting no. We just need four Republicans to join us. https://t.co/vC6gcBenZI",
