                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Nearly 33,000 military families rely on TRICARE to provide quality health care to their dependents. However, unlike private insurance, TRICARE only allows dependents to stay on their parents\u2019 health insurance until they are 21. That\u2019s why I\u2019ve co-sponsored the bipartisan Health Care Fairness for Military Families Act to bridge this coverage gap so servicemembers and their dependents have the same access to health care as their civilian counterparts.",
                "text_lang": "en",
