                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Even though President Trump already forced through the largest cut to health care in our nation\u2019s history with the Big Ugly Law, the Administration is once again attacking lifesaving care \u2013 this time by adding prior authorization requirements to Medicare. Under this new program, private companies can use artificial intelligence, rather than medical expertise, to conduct private screenings and determine whether patients should receive coverage for dozens of procedures. Delaying and denying care is never the answer.",
                "text_lang": "en",
