                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The President\u2019s new 100% tariff on select prescription drugs is shortsighted and cruel. Too many Americans already struggle to afford their prescription drugs. This reckless economic policy - coupled with expiring ACA tax credits and the largest Medicaid cuts in history - will force tens of millions of Americans to pay more for basic medical care and stress our healthcare system beyond its capacity.\n\nhttps://t.co/ikIwLu4ZLh",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
