                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "\ud83d\udc9c Since 1998, Anne Arundel Medical Center has been home to one of the first domestic violence programs in Maryland, ensuring every patient had access to life-saving healthcare AND trained advocates and intervention services. Thank you to Sheriff Sesker, the Anne Arundel County Sheriff\u2019s Department, and AAMC for organizing the third annual Purple Lights Night to raise awareness and honor the survivors of domestic violence. This Domestic Violence Awareness Month, I\u2019m so grateful to join and thank our local partners who are committed to modernizing our systems and providing resources to combat domestic violence across Maryland.",
