                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "You are hearing a lot about Democrats\u00a0fighting hard for health care right now because the expiring ACA tax credits are just one part of the health care crisis in our country. President Trump\u2019s Big Ugly Law was the largest cut to Medicaid in U.S. history, and his new 100% tariffs on imported pharmaceuticals are already driving up costs and stripping life-saving coverage for our hardworking families. Our health care system is so fragile, and that is why we are fighting to keep people covered and make premiums affordable.",
